    {
      "id": "lake-ritual-p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "当收集到的物件被安置到木屋中的树状结构后，房间出现了明确的仪式性图案。此前分散的钓获物和室内线索，在这一刻被组织成同一个结果。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "When the collected objects are placed on the tree-like structure inside the cabin, a ritual pattern becomes visible. The scattered catches and indoor clues are finally organized into one outcome."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-the-lake-game"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lake-ritual-p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "但默认路线并没有带来真正的安全。水面外的黑暗人形逐渐靠近，之前积累的异样在此刻转化成直接威胁。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "The default route does not produce genuine safety. A dark humanlike figure draws closer from beyond the water, turning the unease accumulated so far into an immediate threat."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-the-lake-game"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lake-ritual-p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "这一结局并不是唯一结果。游戏从一开始就用“改变命运”的表述埋下另一条路径，而答案不完全属于这间木屋。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "This ending is not the only possible outcome. The game's own 'change your fate' framing points toward another path, and the missing knowledge does not belong entirely to this cabin."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "official-the-lake-page",
          "primary-the-lake-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lake-ritual-p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "因此 The Lake 的结构在这里出现第一次真正的跨作品分叉：只阅读这一份档案，可以理解危险；带着前作的记忆回来，才会看到另一种命运。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "The Lake therefore reaches the archive's first genuine cross-game fork: this file alone explains the danger, while returning with memory from the earlier game reveals another fate."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-the-lake-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lake-ritual-note",
      "type": "note",
      "title": {
        "zhHans": "结局记录",
        "en": "Ending Record"
      },
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "档案记录不同结局的叙事差异，但不会把它展开成密码或操作顺序。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "The archive records narrative differences between endings without turning them into a password or action sequence."
          }
        ]
      },
